    "selected_scope": "Exact original Theorem3.1, any type0 localface in standard apartment with vertex in cocharacter latticeY, fixerK_F,infiniteWv, under complete authored independent-root/coroot root generating system and thick-finite/positive/type-preserving strongly-transitive masure with affine stabilizerWv semidirectY. No topological-group topology makesK_F compact and open. Full necessary introductoryRemark,all Sections2–3,and complete28-entry bibliography; no completed-algebra/center/parameter/helper variant.",
